  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan is a country bestowed with young and entrepreneurial population. Still, the country has not yet fully realized the potential of these youth offer for economic growth. Lack of work and business opportunities together with poor economic development and inadequate access to financial and training services and weak institutional framework are some of the biggest challenges faced by Pakistan. Despite, the efforts to turn the problems into opportunities, the progress has remained marginal. Fu</narrative>
  </description>
